{"vid":"ahXLLdjo6FY","source":"ahXLLdjo6FY.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.3,"txt":"Have you ever really thought about the"},{"t":2,"txt":"true cost of the buildings all around"},{"t":3.8,"txt":"us? You know, the places we live and"},{"t":6.2,"txt":"work in every single day. It's way more"},{"t":9,"txt":"than just bricks and mortar. Today,"},{"t":11.1,"txt":"we're deconstructing a massive shift and"},{"t":13.8,"txt":"how we build our world. Sustainable"},{"t":16.1,"txt":"construction. Let's get right into it."},{"t":18.6,"txt":"When you think about carbon emissions,"},{"t":20.2,"txt":"your mind probably jumps to cars, maybe"},{"t":22.6,"txt":"factories. But get a load of this"},{"t":24.5,"txt":"number. In the UK, our built"},{"t":26.3,"txt":"environment, that's all our buildings"},{"t":28,"txt":"and infrastructure, is responsible for a"},{"t":30.4,"txt":"staggering 47% of greenhouse gas"},{"t":33.1,"txt":"emissions. Yeah, that's almost half."},{"t":35.7,"txt":"This is not some small piece of the"},{"t":37.4,"txt":"puzzle. It's one of the biggest"},{"t":38.8,"txt":"challenges we have to face if we're"},{"t":40.5,"txt":"serious about tackling climate change."},{"t":43,"txt":"So, how in the world do we fix this?"},{"t":45.9,"txt":"Well, in this explainer, we're going to"},{"t":47.7,"txt":"build the solution piece by piece."},{"t":49.8,"txt":"First, we'll get a real handle on the"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"full environmental footprint. Then we'll"},{"t":54,"txt":"explore the new philosophy that's"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"guiding the entire industry. It's called"},{"t":57.8,"txt":"ESG. From there, we'll crack open the"},{"t":60.5,"txt":"sustainable toolbox to see the materials"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"and the tech making a real difference."},{"t":64.6,"txt":"We'll also cover the standards that, you"},{"t":66.5,"txt":"know, measure what actually matters. And"},{"t":68.8,"txt":"finally, we'll look ahead to the future"},{"t":70.5,"txt":"that we're all building together. Okay."},{"t":72.8,"txt":"So, to understand the solution, we first"},{"t":75,"txt":"have to wrap our heads around the sheer"},{"t":76.8,"txt":"scale of the problem. Our world is quite"},{"t":79.9,"txt":"literally built on a foundation of"},{"t":82.2,"txt":"massive resource consumption. And you"},{"t":84.3,"txt":"know the impact goes way beyond just"},{"t":86.5,"txt":"carbon. The construction industry"},{"t":88.4,"txt":"generates a third of all our landfill"},{"t":90.5,"txt":"waste. It uses half I mean half of all"},{"t":93.7,"txt":"the water we consume. Every new"},{"t":95.7,"txt":"building, every road, every bridge comes"},{"t":97.6,"txt":"with this huge environmental price tag."},{"t":99.9,"txt":"From the materials we literally rip out"},{"t":101.9,"txt":"of the ground to the mountains of waste"},{"t":103.7,"txt":"we leave behind. an impact of this"},{"t":106.3,"txt":"magnitude, it demands a completely new"},{"t":109.7,"txt":"blueprint. And that's exactly where ESG"},{"t":113.1,"txt":"comes in. It's a framework that is"},{"t":115.8,"txt":"totally redefining what value even means"},{"t":118.7,"txt":"in the world of construction. So what is"},{"t":121.7,"txt":"ESG? It stands for environmental,"},{"t":125,"txt":"social, and governance. It's basically a"},{"t":127.8,"txt":"way to measure a project's performance,"},{"t":129.7,"txt":"not just on how much money it makes, but"},{"t":131.8,"txt":"on a much broader, more responsible set"},{"t":134.2,"txt":"of criteria. Think of it like a holistic"},{"t":137,"txt":"report card for a building project that"},{"t":139.2,"txt":"goes so much deeper than just being"},{"t":141.2,"txt":"green. Let's break that down. The E for"},{"t":143.7,"txt":"environment, that's the obvious one,"},{"t":145.5,"txt":"minimizing carbon, using resources"},{"t":147.8,"txt":"wisely, managing waste. Then there's S"},{"t":150.4,"txt":"for social, which is all about people,"},{"t":152.5,"txt":"worker safety, fair labor practices, and"},{"t":155,"txt":"how a project actually affects the local"},{"t":157.1,"txt":"community. And finally, G for"},{"t":159.5,"txt":"governance. This is about the process"},{"t":161.4,"txt":"itself. Is it transparent? Are risks"},{"t":163.8,"txt":"managed properly? It's really that"},{"t":165.6,"txt":"triple bottom line you hear about."},{"t":167.5,"txt":"Planet, people, and profit all working"},{"t":170,"txt":"together. And this is where you really"},{"t":172.4,"txt":"see the fundamental shift in thinking."},{"t":175,"txt":"Conventional construction has always had"},{"t":177,"txt":"this linear kind of take, make waste"},{"t":179.7,"txt":"mindset, focusing only on the upfront"},{"t":182.1,"txt":"cost. But sustainable construction, it"},{"t":185.1,"txt":"thinks in circles. You're minimizing"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"waste right from the get-go. You're"},{"t":189.3,"txt":"using materials that can be multic. That"},{"t":191.9,"txt":"means recycled over and over without"},{"t":194.2,"txt":"losing quality. And you're focusing on"},{"t":196.2,"txt":"the whole life value of a building, not"},{"t":198.6,"txt":"just what it costs to put up today. Now,"},{"t":200.6,"txt":"this isn't just a bunch of nice ideas."},{"t":202.7,"txt":"Let's actually open up the sustainable"},{"t":204.5,"txt":"toolbox and see the powerful tools and"},{"t":207.1,"txt":"innovative materials that are making"},{"t":209,"txt":"this a reality right now. This quote"},{"t":211.7,"txt":"here from BIM site manager Hervey Yimna"},{"t":214.6,"txt":"Mangu absolutely nails it. He points to"},{"t":218,"txt":"digital innovation as a huge pillar."},{"t":221,"txt":"Tools like BIM, that's building"},{"t":223,"txt":"information modeling, let you create a"},{"t":225,"txt":"precise digital twin of a building"},{"t":227.1,"txt":"before a single shovel hits the dirt."},{"t":229.8,"txt":"You combine that with IoT sensors and"},{"t":232.2,"txt":"AI, and suddenly teams can plan"},{"t":234.7,"txt":"everything perfectly, catch errors"},{"t":236.9,"txt":"early, and optimize every single piece"},{"t":239.4,"txt":"of material, which drastically cuts down"},{"t":241.8,"txt":"on waste. But it's not just about"},{"t":243.9,"txt":"digital tools. The choice of material is"},{"t":246.6,"txt":"critical. Let's take steel for example."},{"t":249.4,"txt":"Probably not the first thing you think"},{"t":251,"txt":"about is sustainable, right? But the"},{"t":253,"txt":"data here is fascinating. In the UK, 99%"},{"t":256.7,"txt":"of structural steel from demolition"},{"t":258.6,"txt":"sites gets either recycled or reused."},{"t":262.1,"txt":"And because it can be multiccled"},{"t":264,"txt":"basically forever without losing its"},{"t":266.1,"txt":"strength, it's a perfect material for a"},{"t":268,"txt":"circular economy. It's a fantastic"},{"t":270.5,"txt":"example of just choosing smarter,"},{"t":272.3,"txt":"stronger materials from the very"},{"t":273.8,"txt":"beginning. Okay, so we've got the"},{"t":275.8,"txt":"philosophy, we've got the tools, but how"},{"t":278.3,"txt":"do we make sure this is all being done"},{"t":280.2,"txt":"correctly? And you know what's really"},{"t":282.2,"txt":"driving this change? That brings us to"},{"t":284.6,"txt":"the standards and of course the money"},{"t":287.1,"txt":"that powers this whole system. These"},{"t":289.7,"txt":"right here are the rule books."},{"t":291.8,"txt":"International standards like CEQR,"},{"t":294.6,"txt":"Envision, and Sewer give us a"},{"t":297.1,"txt":"consistent, verifiable way to rate a"},{"t":300,"txt":"project's ESG performance. They're"},{"t":302.5,"txt":"basically a scorecard which lets"},{"t":304.4,"txt":"developers prove their sustainability"},{"t":306.3,"txt":"claims and gives investors the"},{"t":308.3,"txt":"confidence that a project is actually"},{"t":310.4,"txt":"meeting high environmental and ethical"},{"t":312.7,"txt":"standards. And let's take a quick look"},{"t":315,"txt":"inside one of these standards. This"},{"t":317.3,"txt":"chart shows the waiting for sewer."},{"t":319,"txt":"Right? Did you notice something really"},{"t":321.4,"txt":"interesting here? The environmental"},{"t":323.5,"txt":"piece is only about a third of the"},{"t":325.4,"txt":"score. Social and governance factors"},{"t":327.9,"txt":"actually make up the other 2/3. This"},{"t":330.6,"txt":"just proves that true sustainability is"},{"t":333,"txt":"about way more than just carbon"},{"t":334.6,"txt":"emissions. It's a balanced look at a"},{"t":336.9,"txt":"project's total impact. But does anyone"},{"t":339.8,"txt":"actually care about these scores? Well,"},{"t":342.6,"txt":"to figure that out, you just have to"},{"t":344.2,"txt":"follow the money. This chart shows the"},{"t":346.4,"txt":"percentage of big investment funds using"},{"t":348.5,"txt":"ESG standards. And look at that. It"},{"t":351,"txt":"nearly doubled in just 6 years. This is"},{"t":353.4,"txt":"the financial muscle that's driving the"},{"t":355.3,"txt":"movement. Investors are demanding"},{"t":357.2,"txt":"responsible, sustainable projects. It's"},{"t":359.7,"txt":"no longer just a nice to have. And this"},{"t":362,"txt":"is where it all comes full circle. Right"},{"t":364,"txt":"back to the bottom line. Research shows"},{"t":366.2,"txt":"again and again that strong ESG"},{"t":368.3,"txt":"performance leads to better financial"},{"t":370.1,"txt":"performance and higher property values."},{"t":372.2,"txt":"The market is finally realizing that"},{"t":374.2,"txt":"sustainability isn't a cost. It's"},{"t":376.5,"txt":"actually an investment in resilience and"},{"t":378.5,"txt":"long-term value. So, what does this all"},{"t":380.6,"txt":"mean for the future? Well, we're seeing"},{"t":382.8,"txt":"this fundamental shift where sustainable"},{"t":385.1,"txt":"construction is moving from being a"},{"t":387,"txt":"niche interest to a core business"},{"t":389.2,"txt":"strategy. It's becoming a mustdo. Here's"},{"t":392.3,"txt":"the key takeaway. Really, sustainability"},{"t":394.8,"txt":"is becoming synonymous with quality."},{"t":397.1,"txt":"It's about creating buildings and"},{"t":398.7,"txt":"infrastructure that are more efficient"},{"t":400.2,"txt":"to run, more resilient to a changing"},{"t":402.3,"txt":"climate, and ultimately way more"},{"t":404.6,"txt":"valuable to both investors and society"},{"t":407,"txt":"as a whole. It's moving from being a"},{"t":409.2,"txt":"cost center to a powerful competitive"},{"t":411.5,"txt":"advantage. Which leaves us with a final"},{"t":413.5,"txt":"thought. The next time you walk into an"},{"t":415.6,"txt":"office, a house, or any building at all,"},{"t":418.4,"txt":"just ask yourself, what was its cost to"},{"t":420.6,"txt":"build? And maybe more importantly, what"},{"t":423,"txt":"is its true sustainable value for"}],"words":[{"t":0.32,"w":"Have"},{"t":0.56,"w":"you"},{"t":0.719,"w":"ever"},{"t":0.96,"w":"really"},{"t":1.199,"w":"thought"},{"t":1.52,"w":"about"},{"t":1.68,"w":"the"},{"t":2,"w":"true"},{"t":2.24,"w":"cost"},{"t":2.48,"w":"of"},{"t":2.72,"w":"the"},{"t":2.96,"w":"buildings"},{"t":3.28,"w":"all"},{"t":3.52,"w":"around"},{"t":3.84,"w":"us?"},{"t":4.56,"w":"You"},{"t":4.72,"w":"know,"},{"t":4.88,"w":"the"},{"t":5.2,"w":"places"},{"t":5.44,"w":"we"},{"t":5.759,"w":"live"},{"t":5.92,"w":"and"},{"t":6.16,"w":"work"},{"t":6.319,"w":"in"},{"t":6.72,"w":"every"},{"t":7.04,"w":"single"},{"t":7.44,"w":"day."},{"t":8.16,"w":"It's"},{"t":8.4,"w":"way"},{"t":8.72,"w":"more"},{"t":8.96,"w":"than"},{"t":9.12,"w":"just"},{"t":9.36,"w":"bricks"},{"t":9.679,"w":"and"},{"t":9.84,"w":"mortar."},{"t":10.639,"w":"Today,"},{"t":11.12,"w":"we're"},{"t":11.36,"w":"deconstructing"},{"t":12.24,"w":"a"},{"t":12.559,"w":"massive"},{"t":13.04,"w":"shift"},{"t":13.599,"w":"and"},{"t":13.84,"w":"how"},{"t":14,"w":"we"},{"t":14.24,"w":"build"},{"t":14.48,"w":"our"},{"t":14.719,"w":"world."},{"t":15.36,"w":"Sustainable"},{"t":16.08,"w":"construction."},{"t":17.039,"w":"Let's"},{"t":17.359,"w":"get"},{"t":17.52,"w":"right"},{"t":17.68,"w":"into"},{"t":17.92,"w":"it."},{"t":18.56,"w":"When"},{"t":18.8,"w":"you"},{"t":18.96,"w":"think"},{"t":19.039,"w":"about"},{"t":19.279,"w":"carbon"},{"t":19.68,"w":"emissions,"},{"t":20.24,"w":"your"},{"t":20.48,"w":"mind"},{"t":20.8,"w":"probably"},{"t":21.119,"w":"jumps"},{"t":21.439,"w":"to"},{"t":21.68,"w":"cars,"},{"t":22.32,"w":"maybe"},{"t":22.64,"w":"factories."},{"t":23.359,"w":"But"},{"t":23.519,"w":"get"},{"t":23.76,"w":"a"},{"t":23.92,"w":"load"},{"t":24.08,"w":"of"},{"t":24.24,"w":"this"},{"t":24.48,"w":"number."},{"t":24.96,"w":"In"},{"t":25.119,"w":"the"},{"t":25.279,"w":"UK,"},{"t":25.76,"w":"our"},{"t":26,"w":"built"},{"t":26.32,"w":"environment,"},{"t":26.96,"w":"that's"},{"t":27.279,"w":"all"},{"t":27.439,"w":"our"},{"t":27.68,"w":"buildings"},{"t":28,"w":"and"},{"t":28.24,"w":"infrastructure,"},{"t":29.119,"w":"is"},{"t":29.359,"w":"responsible"},{"t":29.92,"w":"for"},{"t":30.16,"w":"a"},{"t":30.4,"w":"staggering"},{"t":31.119,"w":"47%"},{"t":32.16,"w":"of"},{"t":32.399,"w":"greenhouse"},{"t":32.88,"w":"gas"},{"t":33.12,"w":"emissions."},{"t":34.079,"w":"Yeah,"},{"t":34.48,"w":"that's"},{"t":34.8,"w":"almost"},{"t":35.04,"w":"half."},{"t":35.68,"w":"This"},{"t":35.92,"w":"is"},{"t":36.079,"w":"not"},{"t":36.239,"w":"some"},{"t":36.559,"w":"small"},{"t":36.88,"w":"piece"},{"t":37.12,"w":"of"},{"t":37.2,"w":"the"},{"t":37.44,"w":"puzzle."},{"t":37.92,"w":"It's"},{"t":38.16,"w":"one"},{"t":38.32,"w":"of"},{"t":38.32,"w":"the"},{"t":38.559,"w":"biggest"},{"t":38.8,"w":"challenges"},{"t":39.2,"w":"we"},{"t":39.52,"w":"have"},{"t":39.68,"w":"to"},{"t":39.84,"w":"face"},{"t":40,"w":"if"},{"t":40.239,"w":"we're"},{"t":40.48,"w":"serious"},{"t":40.8,"w":"about"},{"t":41.12,"w":"tackling"},{"t":41.68,"w":"climate"},{"t":42.079,"w":"change."},{"t":43.04,"w":"So,"},{"t":43.68,"w":"how"},{"t":43.84,"w":"in"},{"t":44.079,"w":"the"},{"t":44.239,"w":"world"},{"t":44.48,"w":"do"},{"t":44.64,"w":"we"},{"t":44.879,"w":"fix"},{"t":45.12,"w":"this?"},{"t":45.92,"w":"Well,"},{"t":46.32,"w":"in"},{"t":46.559,"w":"this"},{"t":46.8,"w":"explainer,"},{"t":47.36,"w":"we're"},{"t":47.52,"w":"going"},{"t":47.6,"w":"to"},{"t":47.68,"w":"build"},{"t":47.92,"w":"the"},{"t":48.16,"w":"solution"},{"t":48.559,"w":"piece"},{"t":48.879,"w":"by"},{"t":49.12,"w":"piece."},{"t":49.76,"w":"First,"},{"t":50.079,"w":"we'll"},{"t":50.32,"w":"get"},{"t":50.48,"w":"a"},{"t":50.64,"w":"real"},{"t":50.96,"w":"handle"},{"t":51.28,"w":"on"},{"t":51.44,"w":"the"},{"t":51.68,"w":"full"},{"t":52,"w":"environmental"},{"t":52.64,"w":"footprint."},{"t":53.52,"w":"Then"},{"t":53.76,"w":"we'll"},{"t":54,"w":"explore"},{"t":54.32,"w":"the"},{"t":54.559,"w":"new"},{"t":54.719,"w":"philosophy"},{"t":55.28,"w":"that's"},{"t":55.6,"w":"guiding"},{"t":55.92,"w":"the"},{"t":56.16,"w":"entire"},{"t":56.48,"w":"industry."},{"t":57.199,"w":"It's"},{"t":57.44,"w":"called"},{"t":57.84,"w":"ESG."},{"t":59.12,"w":"From"},{"t":59.28,"w":"there,"},{"t":59.52,"w":"we'll"},{"t":59.84,"w":"crack"},{"t":60.079,"w":"open"},{"t":60.32,"w":"the"},{"t":60.48,"w":"sustainable"},{"t":61.039,"w":"toolbox"},{"t":61.6,"w":"to"},{"t":61.76,"w":"see"},{"t":61.92,"w":"the"},{"t":62.16,"w":"materials"},{"t":62.559,"w":"and"},{"t":62.8,"w":"the"},{"t":62.96,"w":"tech"},{"t":63.28,"w":"making"},{"t":63.52,"w":"a"},{"t":63.76,"w":"real"},{"t":64,"w":"difference."},{"t":64.64,"w":"We'll"},{"t":64.879,"w":"also"},{"t":65.119,"w":"cover"},{"t":65.28,"w":"the"},{"t":65.519,"w":"standards"},{"t":65.92,"w":"that,"},{"t":66.32,"w":"you"},{"t":66.479,"w":"know,"},{"t":66.64,"w":"measure"},{"t":67.04,"w":"what"},{"t":67.36,"w":"actually"},{"t":67.76,"w":"matters."},{"t":68.56,"w":"And"},{"t":68.799,"w":"finally,"},{"t":69.2,"w":"we'll"},{"t":69.439,"w":"look"},{"t":69.6,"w":"ahead"},{"t":69.84,"w":"to"},{"t":70.08,"w":"the"},{"t":70.24,"w":"future"},{"t":70.479,"w":"that"},{"t":70.72,"w":"we're"},{"t":70.96,"w":"all"},{"t":71.2,"w":"building"},{"t":71.6,"w":"together."},{"t":72.32,"w":"Okay."},{"t":72.799,"w":"So,"},{"